"1802","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu Amelaani khamr, na anayekamua, na anayekamuliwa, na anayekunywa, na anayemnywesha, na anayebeba, na anayebebewa, na anayeuza, na anayenunua, na anayekula thamani yake."
"1803","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu Mtukufu alipoumba viumbe Aliandika kwa Mkono Wake juu ya nafsi Yake: Hakika rehema Yangu inashinda ghadhabu Yangu."
