"1821","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu Hustaajabu mja anaposema: Hapana mungu apasaye kuabudiwa kwa haki isipokuwa Wewe, hakika mimi nimeidhulumu nafsi yangu, basi nighufurie dhambi zangu — kwani hakika hapana a ghufuriae dhambi isipokuwa Wewe; Husema: Mja Wangu ametambua kwamba ana Mola Aghfuriaye na aadhibuye."
