"1825","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu Mtukufu yuko pamoja na mdeni mpaka alipe deni lake, madamu deni lake halikuwa katika anayoyachukia Mwenyezi Mungu."
"1826","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu yuko pamoja na qadhi madamu hajafanya dhulma kwa makusudi; akifanya dhulma Humwachia nafsi yake."
"1827","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu Mtukufu yuko pamoja na qadhi madamu hajafanya dhulma; akifanya dhulma Hujitenga naye na kumlazimisha Shetani."
