"1830","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu ni Witri Anapenda witri; mkitumia mawe kujisafisha basi fanyeni witri."
"1831","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu Mtukufu ni Witri Anapenda witri; basi fanyeni witri, enyi watu wa Qur'ani."
