"1833","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu na Mtume Wake wanawakataza nyama za punda wa nyumbani, kwani hakika hizo ni uchafu miongoni mwa amali ya Shetani."
"1834","[AI-translation] Hakika Mwenyezi Mungu Ameweka haki juu ya ulimi wa Umar — anaisema."
